{"type":"excalidraw/clipboard","elements":[{"id":"jNUpy4yJAB82a1M6Z9llx","type":"text","x":186.1271541213724,"y":5575.644219715881,"width":667.281494140625,"height":120,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a0","roundness":null,"seed":1468724991,"version":392,"versionNonce":750784895,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1788013881680,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Functional Requirements\n       - Upload Video: Users should be able to upload videos (up to 100 GB max allowed size).\n       - Watch / Stream Video: Users should be able to stream and watch uploaded videos.\n       - User Should be able to Search Video/ View Video\n       - user should be able to view count\n       - Out of Scope:  Recommendations, comments, likes/dislikes, etc.","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Functional Requirements\n       - Upload Video: Users should be able to upload videos (up to 100 GB max allowed size).\n       - Watch / Stream Video: Users should be able to stream and watch uploaded videos.\n       - User Should be able to Search Video/ View Video\n       - user should be able to view count\n       - Out of Scope:  Recommendations, comments, likes/dislikes, etc.","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"WUFPz3yCL8EIoeQKJaVAq","type":"text","x":1384.3244487426618,"y":5291.518045590033,"width":231.8060100273418,"height":40.79933544582128,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a1","roundness":null,"seed":775012127,"version":379,"versionNonce":1755936881,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1788013337018,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Design youtube","fontSize":32.63946835665704,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Design youtube","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"_93fQmDXuHprq5rFVnrMo","type":"text","x":175.06034096353324,"y":5717.232279780775,"width":603.4066162109375,"height":600,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a2","roundness":null,"seed":1896514367,"version":847,"versionNonce":1797079839,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1788013337018,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Non-Functional Requirement\n    - CAP Requirements:\n           - Availability: \n                - video playback, \n                - metadata\n                - view count.\n            Consistency: \n                - video transcoding workflows.\n    \n    - Latency: Video playback start latency < 200 ms.\n    \n    - Capacity & Scale Estimates\n        - Daily Active Users (DAU): 100 Million\n        - Traffic Estimates:(Peak 10X)\n            - Uploads: ~10% of DAU = 10 Million uploads videos/day ≈ 100 uploads/sec \n                   - (Peak: 1,000 uploads/sec)\n            - Read : 10 views/user/day = 1 Billion views/day ≈ 10,000 views/sec \n                    - (Peak: 100,000 views/sec)\n            - Read-to-Write Ratio: 100:1 \n\n        - Storage Estimates:\n            - Blob s3\n                - Average 10 minutes @ 1 Mbps ≈ 100 MB\n                - Per day: 1010Million uploads/day × 100 MB ≈ 1 TB/day\n            - metadata DB\n                - Size : 1KB\n                - Per Day: 10Million* 1KB = 10GB per Day\n            - Video Streaming\n                - 5mbps\n            ","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Non-Functional Requirement\n    - CAP Requirements:\n           - Availability: \n                - video playback, \n                - metadata\n                - view count.\n            Consistency: \n                - video transcoding workflows.\n    \n    - Latency: Video playback start latency < 200 ms.\n    \n    - Capacity & Scale Estimates\n        - Daily Active Users (DAU): 100 Million\n        - Traffic Estimates:(Peak 10X)\n            - Uploads: ~10% of DAU = 10 Million uploads videos/day ≈ 100 uploads/sec \n                   - (Peak: 1,000 uploads/sec)\n            - Read : 10 views/user/day = 1 Billion views/day ≈ 10,000 views/sec \n                    - (Peak: 100,000 views/sec)\n            - Read-to-Write Ratio: 100:1 \n\n        - Storage Estimates:\n            - Blob s3\n                - Average 10 minutes @ 1 Mbps ≈ 100 MB\n                - Per day: 1010Million uploads/day × 100 MB ≈ 1 TB/day\n            - metadata DB\n                - Size : 1KB\n                - Per Day: 10Million* 1KB = 10GB per Day\n            - Video Streaming\n                - 5mbps\n            ","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"XxbYutEn9_GWhGJQ1N32-","type":"text","x":912.9845322257672,"y":5534.939767860377,"width":73.47215270996094,"height":20,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"a3","roundness":null,"seed":1081459551,"version":303,"versionNonce":1386431057,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[],"updated":1788013337018,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"High level","fontSize":16,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"High level","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"kMeRKD7ZoNzdj7HUIvgcP","type":"rectangle","x":927.5506961936078,"y":5771.81815798596,"width":115.55188915403164,"height":65.86458538686111,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":1,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"in