lse,"text":"Kafka\n- topic: video.viewed\n- partitions: 100, key = videoId\n- consumer groups:\n   flink-trending    -> Redis trending:home\n   flink-watchtime   -> payouts DB\n   flink-enrich      -> Snowflake\n   raw-archiver      -> S3 (cheap replay)","fontSize":9.118601099798614,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Kafka\n- topic: video.viewed\n- partitions: 100, key = videoId\n- consumer groups:\n   flink-trending    -> Redis trending:home\n   flink-watchtime   -> payouts DB\n   flink-enrich      -> Snowflake\n   raw-archiver      -> S3 (cheap replay)","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"BzBrZNfgJDr6jg-NXFDHC","type":"text","x":1831.3854850562434,"y":7463.222470126494,"width":298.90625,"height":213.59958885230475,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b26","roundness":null,"seed":1173178751,"version":167,"versionNonce":642064657,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"id":"oZ4kvyEvQBJM0l_52Qnkr","type":"arrow"}],"updated":1788013802866,"link":null,"locked":false,"text":"Apache Flink\n- consumes: video.viewed (own consumer groups)\n    just another Kafka subscriber, pulls at its own speed\n\n- job1 dedupe    keyBy(userId+videoId), 30m RocksDB state\n    same user watching 400 times counts once\n\n- job2 trending  sliding 1h / slide 1m -> Redis trending:home\n    \"views in last hour\", recalculated every minute\n\n- job3 watchtime tumbling 1d per creator -> payouts DB\n    total seconds watched per day, drives creator payment\n\n- job4 enrich    join video.metadata.changed -> Snowflake\n    view event has no category, join adds it before warehouse\n\n- checkpoints state + offsets to S3 -> exactly-once\n    pod dies, restores window count and offset together, no double pay","fontSize":9.493315060102434,"fontFamily":6,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","containerId":null,"originalText":"Apache Flink\n- consumes: video.viewed (own consumer groups)\n    just another Kafka subscriber, pulls at its own speed\n\n- job1 dedupe    keyBy(userId+videoId), 30m RocksDB state\n    same user watching 400 times counts once\n\n- job2 trending  sliding 1h / slide 1m -> Redis trending:home\n    \"views in last hour\", recalculated every minute\n\n- job3 watchtime tumbling 1d per creator -> payouts DB\n    total seconds watched per day, drives creator payment\n\n- job4 enrich    join video.metadata.changed -> Snowflake\n    view event has no category, join adds it before warehouse\n\n- checkpoints state + offsets to S3 -> exactly-once\n    pod dies, restores window count and offset together, no double pay","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25},{"id":"_YqduuZEslzNeAJn5p7PW","type":"rectangle","x":1815.315138,"y":7448.535298,"width":338.0302835231007,"height":253.52264726010162,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b28","roundness":{"type":3},"seed":1255589137,"version":135,"versionNonce":1477307615,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":[{"id":"oZ4kvyEvQBJM0l_52Qnkr","type":"arrow"}],"updated":1788013745320,"link":null,"locked":false},{"id":"oZ4kvyEvQBJM0l_52Qnkr","type":"arrow","x":1748.0705361440405,"y":7497.289789938672,"width":61.744601855959445,"height":0.7597978631010847,"angle":0,"strokeColor":"#1e1e1e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dotted","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"groupIds":[],"frameId":null,"index":"b2A","roundness":null,"seed":355523601,"version":95,"versionNonce":876162609,"isDeleted":false,"boundElements":null,"updated":1788013806077,"link":null,"locked":false,"points":[[0,0],[61.744601855959445,0.7597978631010847]],"startBinding":{"elementId":"AtDT2B8Imk7i8Z4_4DAjN","mode":"orbit","fixedPoint":[0.9999999999999994,0.5001]},"endBinding":{"elementId":"_YqduuZEslzNeAJn5p7PW","mode":"orbit","fixedPoint":[0.19883449651380133,0.19883449651380344]},"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"triangle","elbowed":false,"moveMidPointsWithElement":false}],"files":{}}